90:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/cbo-context.md`
91:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/customization-context.md`
120:**MANDATORY — runs between `<Spec_Approval_Gate>` and Phase 4.** After spec approval, the skill prompts the user to pick an execution cadence: `auto` / `manual` / `hybrid`. Persists the choice to `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/state.json` under `execution_mode`.
124:Full procedure — verbatim mode-prompt text, per-mode semantics, state.json schema (also drives C-2 resume support), and manual-mode phase-transition prompt — lives in **[`execution-mode.md`](execution-mode.md)**. Read that file and follow it literally before dispatching Phase 4.
137:- Phase 5 — QA (`sap-qa-tester`, OOP mode)
156:- `RunUnitTest` / `GetUnitTestResult` — QA (OOP mode)
160:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/platform.md` — Phase 0 preflight output
161:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/module-interview.md` — Phase 1A business interview (consultant-led: purpose / reason / company-specific rules / reference assets / standard-SAP alternatives)
162:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/interview.md` — Phase 1B technical interview (analyst+architect-led: 7 dimensions + 2a code template Q&A log)
163:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/cbo-context.md` — CBO reuse candidates (written by `<Inventory_Lookups>` / [`inventory-lookups.md`](inventory-lookups.md))
164:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/customization-context.md` — Z*/Y* BAdI impl / CMOD / form-exit / append reuse candidates (written by `<Inventory_Lookups>` / [`inventory-lookups.md`](inventory-lookups.md))
165:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/ddic-brief.md` — Haiku `sap-checker` scout facts for objects named in Phase 1A (read before any `Get*` by 1B / consultants / planner)
166:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/plan.md` — planner output
167:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/spec.md` — writer output (requires user confirm)
168:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/state.json` — execution_mode + per-phase status/timing (schema in `execution-mode.md`, drives resume support)
169:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/verify-phase4.md` — Haiku verify results for text pools, screens, GUI statuses, inactive count (see `phase4-verify.md`)
170:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/review-bucket-{B1|B2|B3|B4}.md` — Phase 6 per-bucket reviews, `buckets` strategy (merged into review.md, see `phase6-buckets.md`)
171:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/review-candidates.md` — Phase 6 Haiku detector output, `detect-judge` strategy (see `phase6-detect-judge.md`)
172:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/review.md` — Phase 6 consolidated review
173:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/decisions.md` — executor `## Decisions` lines, appended by main (feeds the report's *Decisions & Assumptions*)
174:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/report.md` — final completion report (Evidence first, per `common/verification-evidence.md`)
175:- `.sc4sap/program/{PROG}/{spec,report}.html` — optional single-file HTML copies, offered after Phase 8

